From f08f56a4bf24df5eaf0514a79252374dc4cd6a9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 05:47:42 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Rename nsxiv to rsxiv

Rename the program, binary, header (rsxiv.h), man page, desktop file,
icons, macros, install paths and per-user config paths
($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/rsxiv/{exec,rsxivbg}) from nsxiv to rsxiv.

Upstream attribution is kept: the "nsxiv contributors" copyright lines,
links to the upstream nsxiv/sxiv repositories, and the historical
CHANGELOG are left unchanged. README and the man page now state that
rsxiv is a fork of nsxiv.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019WQWTVvJY66HrhGETqJxqQ
